<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64652" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μακρο-θῡμέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be long-suffering</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί
				τινι</span> towards one, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Si.</u>
				18.11
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				18.26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>1 Ep.Thess.</u>
					5.14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be slow</i> to help, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				18.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>persevere</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.593
			</span></i> f. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>bear patiently</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ba.</u>
				4.25
			</span></i>: imper. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μακροθύμει</span>
			<i>bear up</i>! <i><span class="en">
				Astramps.
				<u>Orac.</u>
				90.7
			</span></i>.</div>
